        "id": "ch6_2_4-1",
        "text": "Applets\nSimilar to Cinnamon, MATE also provides applets that you can add to any of the\npanels on the desktop from the Add to Panel dialog box shown in Figure 6-8.\nTo add a new applet, follow these steps:\n1. Right-click an empty place in the panel, and then choose Add to Panel to\nopen the Add to Panel dialog box.\n2. Click the applet you want to add.\n3. Click the Add button.\nThe applet appears in the main panel.\n4. Right-click the applet and select Move.\n5. Move the mouse pointer to reposition the applet on the current panel, or\npoint to another panel to move the applet to that panel. Click the\nlocation where you want the applet to reside.\nFIGURE 6-8:\nThe Add to Panel\ndialog box in\nMATE.\n112   PART 1 Getting Your Feet Wet",
